            &lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Roast for 30 minutes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Simmer with stock.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Blend.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div role="tabpanel" id="panel-notes" aria-labelledby="tab-notes" tabindex="0" hidden&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;Freezes well for up to three months.&lt;/p&gt;
